        "acceptedPr": null,
        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Fix chat resume ranking and add network retry for agent validation",
        "summary": "The `--continue` flag now resumes the correct chat session by ranking saved chat files rather than directory modification times, preventing the empty log directory created at launch from being selected. In the SDK, remote agent validation now retries the HTTP POST once when Bun reuses a closed socket after idle, using `isTransientNetworkError` to detect transient failures. These two fixes address a bug where the newest directory was always the current launch's log folder, and a flaky network issue that blocked CLI sends after idle periods.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "In `cli/src/project-files.ts`, `getMostRecentChatDir` now ranks chat directories by the `mtimeMs` of `run-state.json` or `chat-messages.json` instead of the directory mtime. In `sdk/src/validate-agents.ts`, the remote fetch is wrapped in a `post` helper that retries once via `isTransientNetworkError`.",
        "userVisible": true,
        "confidence": "medium",
        "changes": [
          {
            "area": "cli",
            "what": "Updated `getMostRecentChatDir` to rank chats by saved file mtime instead of directory mtime so `--continue` skips the empty launch log directory.",
            "files": [
              "cli/src/project-files.ts",
              "cli/src/__tests__/project-files-most-recent-chat.test.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "sdk",
            "what": "Added single-attempt retry for transient network errors in `validateAgents` remote validation to handle socket reuse after idle.",
            "files": [
              "sdk/src/validate-agents.ts",
              "sdk/src/__tests__/validate-agents.test.ts"
            ]
          }
        ],
