        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Choosing to continue a previous conversation now looks at the last time chat files were actually saved, instead of the date the folder was last opened, so the empty folder created by the current launch no longer tricks the system into skipping your real work. The developer toolkit also tries one extra time if a network connection drops while checking agent settings, preventing a temporary blip from blocking your next message. These fixes affect developers using the command-line assistant, improving the accuracy of session resumption and the reliability of background checks after periods of inactivity.",
        "at": "2026-11-24T00:25:14.824Z",
